.Sh BUGS
TypeScript linting doesn't support the
.Fl -eslint-options
or
.Fl -ignore-config
options;
there's no reason these should affect JavaScript linting only.
.Pp
ESLint should be made to respect the
.Ev NO_COLOR
environment variable in the absence of
.Ev FORCE_COLOR .
.Pp
CoffeeLint's
.QQ colon_assignment_spacing
rule expects a fixed number of spaces,
which makes it impossible to vertically-align similar statements across lines; \
a custom rule should be written for
.Pa \*[coffee-config]
that supports a variable number of spaces.
